      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} \\text{设各零件的重量为}X_i(i=1,2,\\cdots,5000), \\text{已知}\\mu=E(X_i)&amp;=0.5kg,\\sqrt{D(X_i)}=\\sigma=0.1kg, \\text{总重量}Z=\\sum_{i=1}^{5000}X_i,\\text{所求概率为}\\\\ P\\{Z&gt;2510\\}&amp;=P\\left\\{\\frac{Z-5000\\times 0.5}{0.1\\sqrt{5000}}&gt; \\frac{2510-5000\\times 0.5}{0.1\\sqrt{5000}}\\right\\}\\approx 1-\\Phi\\left(\\frac{10}{0.1\\sqrt{5000}}\\right)\\\\ &amp;=1-\\Phi(1.414)=1-0.9214=0.0786.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} \\text{设各零件的重量为}X_i(i=1,2,\\cdots,5000), \\text{已知}\\mu=E(X_i)&amp;=0.5kg,\\sqrt{D(X_i)}=\\sigma=0.1kg, \\text{总重量}Z=\\sum_{i=1}^{5000}X_i,\\text{所求概率为}\\\\ P\\{Z&gt;2510\\}&amp;=P\\left\\{\\frac{Z-5000\\times 0.5}{0.1\\sqrt{5000}}&gt; \\frac{2510-5000\\times 0.5}{0.1\\sqrt{5000}}\\right\\}\\approx 1-\\Phi\\left(\\frac{10}{0.1\\sqrt{5000}}\\right)\\\\ &amp;=1-\\Phi(1.414)=1-0.9214=0.0786.\\end{aligned}</div>"
