      "prompt_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\begin{array}{l}\\text{设每次射击击中目标的概率为}0.001，\\text{那么如果射击}5000\\text{次}，\\text{根据中心极限定理}，\\text{击中次数不大于}2\\text{的概率}\\\\ \\text{等于}( )．(\\Phi(1.34)=0.9099,\\Phi(1.35)=0.9115,\\Phi(2.23)=0.9871,\\Phi(2.24)=0.9874,\\sqrt{4.995}=2.235)\\end{array}\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}\\begin{array}{l}\\text{设每次射击击中目标的概率为}0.001，\\text{那么如果射击}5000\\text{次}，\\text{根据中心极限定理}，\\text{击中次数不大于}2\\text{的概率}\\\\ \\text{等于}( )．(\\Phi(1.34)=0.9099,\\Phi(1.35)=0.9115,\\Phi(2.23)=0.9871,\\Phi(2.24)=0.9874,\\sqrt{4.995}=2.235)\\end{array}\\end{aligned}</div>",
