      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} \\text{设}X_{i}\\text{表示第}i\\text{次运算中产生的误差，则}X_{1},X_{2},\\cdots,X_{100}\\text{相互独立，都服从[-0.5,0.5]上的均匀分布，} \\\\ E(X_{i})=0,D(X_{i})=1/12,\\;i=1,2,\\cdots,100,\\;\\text{从而} \\\\ Y_{100}=\\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{100}X_{i}-100\\times 0}{\\sqrt{100/12}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{5}\\sum_{i=1}^{100}X_{i}\\stackrel{\\text{定义}}{\\sim}N(0,1). \\\\ \\text{平均误差}\\overline{X}=\\frac{1}{100}\\sum_{i=1}^{100}X_{i}\\text{落在}\\left[-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{20},\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{20}\\right]\\text{上的概率为} \\\\ P\\left\\{-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{20}\\leq\\overline{X}\\leq\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{20}\\right\\}=P\\left\\{-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{20}\\leq\\frac{1}{100}\\sum_{i=1}^{100}X_{i}\\leq\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{20}\\right\\} \\\\ =P\\left\\{-3\\leq\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{5}\\sum_{i=1}^{100}X_{i}\\leq 3\\right\\}\\approx\\Phi(3)-\\Phi(-3)=0.9973.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} \\text{设}X_{i}\\text{表示第}i\\text{次运算中产生的误差，则}X_{1},X_{2},\\cdots,X_{100}\\text{相互独立，都服从[-0.5,0.5]上的均匀分布，} \\\\ E(X_{i})=0,D(X_{i})=1/12,\\;i=1,2,\\cdots,100,\\;\\text{从而} \\\\ Y_{100}=\\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{100}X_{i}-100\\times 0}{\\sqrt{100/12}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{5}\\sum_{i=1}^{100}X_{i}\\stackrel{\\text{定义}}{\\sim}N(0,1). \\\\ \\text{平均误差}\\overline{X}=\\frac{1}{100}\\sum_{i=1}^{100}X_{i}\\text{落在}\\left[-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{20},\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{20}\\right]\\text{上的概率为} \\\\ P\\left\\{-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{20}\\leq\\overline{X}\\leq\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{20}\\right\\}=P\\left\\{-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{20}\\leq\\frac{1}{100}\\sum_{i=1}^{100}X_{i}\\leq\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{20}\\right\\} \\\\ =P\\left\\{-3\\leq\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{5}\\sum_{i=1}^{100}X_{i}\\leq 3\\right\\}\\approx\\Phi(3)-\\Phi(-3)=0.9973.\\end{aligned}</div>"
