      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} \\text{设各部分长度为}X_i\\,(i=1,2,\\cdots,10),\\ \\text{则总长度}Z=\\sum_{i=1}^{10}X_i,\\ \\text{已知}E(X_i)=2,\\ D(X_i)=0.05^2,\\ \\text{依题意，根据林德伯格-勒维中心极限定理，产品合格的概率为}\\\\ P\\{20-0.1\\leq Z\\leq 20+0.1\\}\\\\=P\\left\\{\\frac{-0.1}{0.05\\sqrt{10}}\\leq \\frac{Z-2\\times 10}{0.05\\sqrt{10}}\\leq \\frac{-0.1}{0.05\\sqrt{10}}\\right\\}\\\\ \\approx \\Phi(0.63)-\\Phi(-0.63)=2\\Phi(0.63)-1=2\\times 0.7357-1=0.4714.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} \\text{设各部分长度为}X_i\\,(i=1,2,\\cdots,10),\\ \\text{则总长度}Z=\\sum_{i=1}^{10}X_i,\\ \\text{已知}E(X_i)=2,\\ D(X_i)=0.05^2,\\ \\text{依题意，根据林德伯格-勒维中心极限定理，产品合格的概率为}\\\\ P\\{20-0.1\\leq Z\\leq 20+0.1\\}\\\\=P\\left\\{\\frac{-0.1}{0.05\\sqrt{10}}\\leq \\frac{Z-2\\times 10}{0.05\\sqrt{10}}\\leq \\frac{-0.1}{0.05\\sqrt{10}}\\right\\}\\\\ \\approx \\Phi(0.63)-\\Phi(-0.63)=2\\Phi(0.63)-1=2\\times 0.7357-1=0.4714.\\end{aligned}</div>"
