      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\text{设}X_{i} \\text{为第}i \\text{个螺丝钉的重量，}i=1,2,\\cdots,100,\\text{且它们之间独立同分布，于是一盒螺丝钉的重量为}X=\\sum_{i=1}^{100}X_{i}. \\\\ &amp; \\text{由} \\mu=E(X_{i})=100,\\sigma=\\sqrt{D(X_{i})}=10,\\,n=100,\\text{得}E(X)=100\\times E(X_{i})=10000,\\sqrt{D(X)}=100.\\text{由中心极限定理，有} \\\\ &amp; \\quad P\\{X&gt;10200\\}=P\\left\\{\\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{n}X_{i}-n\\mu}{\\sigma\\sqrt{n}}&gt;\\frac{10200-n\\mu}{\\sigma\\sqrt{n}}\\right\\} \\\\ &amp; \\quad\\quad=P\\left\\{\\frac{X-10000}{100}&gt;\\frac{10200-10000}{100}\\right\\}=P\\left\\{\\frac{X-10000}{100}&gt;2\\right\\} \\\\ &amp; \\quad\\quad=1-P\\left\\{\\frac{X-10000}{100}\\leq2\\right\\}\\approx 1-\\Phi(2)=1-0.97725=0.02275.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\text{设}X_{i} \\text{为第}i \\text{个螺丝钉的重量，}i=1,2,\\cdots,100,\\text{且它们之间独立同分布，于是一盒螺丝钉的重量为}X=\\sum_{i=1}^{100}X_{i}. \\\\ &amp; \\text{由} \\mu=E(X_{i})=100,\\sigma=\\sqrt{D(X_{i})}=10,\\,n=100,\\text{得}E(X)=100\\times E(X_{i})=10000,\\sqrt{D(X)}=100.\\text{由中心极限定理，有} \\\\ &amp; \\quad P\\{X&gt;10200\\}=P\\left\\{\\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{n}X_{i}-n\\mu}{\\sigma\\sqrt{n}}&gt;\\frac{10200-n\\mu}{\\sigma\\sqrt{n}}\\right\\} \\\\ &amp; \\quad\\quad=P\\left\\{\\frac{X-10000}{100}&gt;\\frac{10200-10000}{100}\\right\\}=P\\left\\{\\frac{X-10000}{100}&gt;2\\right\\} \\\\ &amp; \\quad\\quad=1-P\\left\\{\\frac{X-10000}{100}\\leq2\\right\\}\\approx 1-\\Phi(2)=1-0.97725=0.02275.\\end{aligned}</div>"
